# Conditional charged-B signal sample; generic B- table is left unchanged.
# FSR is disabled explicitly in the driver after all decay tables are read.
Alias SignalB B+
Decay Upsilon(4S)
1.0 SignalB B- VSS;
Enddecay

Decay SignalB
0.333333333333 K+ nu_e anti-nu_e KNUNU;
0.333333333333 K+ nu_mu anti-nu_mu KNUNU;
0.333333333334 K+ nu_tau anti-nu_tau KNUNU;
Enddecay
End
